    <string name="shell_companion_title">Install the KOReader plugin</string>
    <string name="shell_companion_body">Enter the folder where KOReader keeps its plugins on your Kindle. Folio adds its plugin there and keeps any previous version. Restart KOReader afterwards.</string>
